 IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>permission are required.</Text></Shape><Shape ID="51" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>8.162912156846788</PinX><PinY>1.6884583367241754</PinY><Width>4.631379869249132</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>2.315689934624566</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.18055555555555555</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#233247</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>Softcopy disposal retires its files. External disposal keeps</Text></Shape><Shape ID="52" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>7.881877051459418</PinX><PinY>1.4217686123318143</PinY><Width>4.069309658474392</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>2.034654829237196</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.18055555555555555</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#233247</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>stored files and revision records but blocks normal</Text></Shape><Shape ID="53" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>6.286485883924696</PinX><PinY>1.1550788879394531</PinY><Width>0.8785273234049479</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>0.43926366170247394</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</Le