#233247</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>Primary and assigned active roles combine permissions.</Text></Shape><Shape ID="50" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>3.252854029337565</PinX><PinY>1.4217686123318143</PinY><Width>4.8668191697862415</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>2.4334095848931208</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.18055555555555555</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#233247</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>The leader receives steps configured as Requester's leader.</Text></Shape><Shape ID="51" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>8.142961714002821</PinX><PinY>1.6884583367241754</PinY><Width>4.591478983561198</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>2.295739491780599</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.18055555555555555</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#233247</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>Users cannot deactivate themselves or change their own</Text></Shape><Shape ID="52" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>8.107752905951607</PinX><PinY>1.4217686123318143</PinY><Width>4.521061367458767</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>2.2605306837293835</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><Lin